sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as TrustyAI LMEval<br/>Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant JobPod as LMEval Job Pod
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap<br/>/meta/job.json
    participant EvalHub as EvalHub Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Model as Model Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Operator,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Benchmark Evaluation Job Execution
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Job + ConfigMap + Secrets<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount Token
        K8sAPI-->>JobPod: Schedule Pod
        JobPod->>ConfigMap: Read job spec<br/>(filesystem mount)
        JobPod->>EvalHub: POST status: INITIALIZING<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
        JobPod->>HFHub: GET datasets & tokenizer<br/>TLS 1.2+ / HF_TOKEN
        JobPod->>EvalHub: POST status: RUNNING_EVALUATION<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token

        loop For each benchmark prompt
            JobPod->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>TLS 1.2+ / OPENAI_API_KEY
            Model-->>JobPod: Completion response
        end

        JobPod->>EvalHub: POST status: POST_PROCESSING<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
        JobPod->>EvalHub: POST status: PERSISTING_ARTIFACTS<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
        JobPod->>OCI: skopeo push (OCI artifact)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Docker auth
        OCI-->>JobPod: Push confirmation
        JobPod->>MLflow: POST metrics & run data<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
        MLflow-->>JobPod: Log confirmation
        JobPod->>EvalHub: POST final results + status: COMPLETE<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over JobPod,Model: Flow 2: Air-Gapped (Offline) Evaluation
        participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
        participant TestData as /test_data<br/>Volume

        Note right of JobPod: Init Container Phase
        JobPod->>S3: Download model assets & datasets<br/>TLS 1.2+ / AWS IAM
        S3-->>JobPod: Model weights + datasets
        JobPod->>TestData: Write to /test_data volume<br/>(filesystem)

        Note right of JobPod: Main Container Phase
        JobPod->>TestData: Read tokenizer + datasets<br/>(auto-detect offline mode)
        Note right of JobPod: Sets HF_DATASETS_OFFLINE=1<br/>TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1<br/>HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1

        loop For each benchmark prompt
            JobPod->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>TLS 1.2+ / OPENAI_API_KEY
            Model-->>JobPod: Completion response
        end

        JobPod->>EvalHub: POST final results<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    end
